{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1",
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "For Talent Seek: Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
      ],
      "justification": "Initializes the process and models the first referee report check step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "At the same time, you should continue to monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Monitors completion status, establishes the decision split, and guards the positive path. Condition re-typed as an action step preserves behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have been completed, you can proceed with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Monitors completion status, establishes the decision split, and guards the positive path. Condition re-typed as an action step preserves behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if they have not been completed, you should flag it and send a reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly guards and executes the first negative branch action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "label:n4->n5",
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed."
      ],
      "justification": "Label provides transition context; action performs the second status verification."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6",
        "guard:b2->c1",
        "label:n5->n6",
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have, you can continue with the process. If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder."
      ],
      "justification": "Implements the second check, positive guard, flow convergence, and explicit proceed step. Preserves the conditional retry logic."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the Referee Reports have been completed, you can move on to organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct paraphrase of organizing interviews."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the interviews, it is necessary to receive feedback from the interview candidates."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact match for receiving candidate feedback."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Checks test requirement, splits flow, and directs to the HR specialist check when required."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Checks test requirement, splits flow, and directs to the HR specialist check when required."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n11",
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If not, you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the 'not required' guard and coordinates the second selection round."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is, you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
      ],
      "justification": "Performs the secondary decision check and initiates the subsequent split."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n12",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If an HR Specialist is required, you should schedule the test with a third party."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly guards and schedules the third-party test."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b4->n13",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Otherwise, you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly guards and completes the test internally."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "label:n11->c2",
        "label:n12->c2",
        "label:n13->c2",
        "action:n14",
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
      ],
      "justification": "Converges all decision paths, executes the final ranking request, and reaches the process boundary. Labels and 'end' action are harmless structural plumbing."
    }
  ],
  "mutations": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->e1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If they have, you can continue with the process. If not, you should flag it again and send another reminder."
      ],
      "reason": "Routes the 'Not Completed' outcome directly to the process end, completely skipping the explicitly required step to flag and send another reminder. This alters control flow and omits a mandatory action."
    }
  ],
